WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.326 --> 00:00:08.762
&gt;&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, WE HEAR FROM THE

00:00:07.895 --> 00:00:10.030
WITNESSES.

00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:11.065
BUT THE F.B.I. ISN'T

00:00:10.164 --> 00:00:13.133
INTERVIEWING THEM.

00:00:11.198 --> 00:00:14.435
AND ISN'T GIVING US ANY FACTS.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:17.538
SO, ALL WE HAVE --

00:00:14.635 --> 00:00:18.739
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE INTERVIEWING ME.

00:00:17.672 --> 00:00:20.141
YOU'RE INTERVIEWING ME.

00:00:18.873 --> 00:00:21.142
YOU'RE DOING IT, SENATOR.

00:00:20.274 --> 00:00:21.742
SORRY TO INTERRUPT.

00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:24.011
YOU'RE DOING IT.

00:00:21.876 --> 00:00:24.378
THERE IS NO CONCLUSIONS

00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:25.813
REACHED.

00:00:24.578 --> 00:00:27.815
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT WAS

00:00:25.946 --> 00:00:28.783
KAVANAUGH RESPONDING TO

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:30.551
SENATOR DIANNE FEINSTEIN OF

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:32.486
CALIFORNIA IN TODAY'S HEARING.

00:00:30.685 --> 00:00:33.921
WE SPOKE TO RETIRED PROFESSOR

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.288
ALAN DERSHOWITZ AHEAD OF THE

00:00:34.055 --> 00:00:36.123
HEARING.

00:00:34.422 --> 00:00:37.491
NOW THAT IT IS OVER WHAT DID

00:00:36.257 --> 00:00:38.559
HE THINK THE OUTCOME?

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:40.628
ALAN DERSHOWITZ ALSO THE

00:00:38.693 --> 00:00:43.731
AUTHOR OF "THE CASE AGAINST

00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:45.466
IMPEACHING TRUMP."

00:00:43.865 --> 00:00:46.567
AND HE HE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.836
THANK YOU FOR COMING ON.

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:49.670
YOU WATCHED THE HEARING FROM

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.072
BEGINNING TO END.

00:00:49.804 --> 00:00:54.275
WHAT IS YOUR ASSESSMENT?

00:00:51.272 --> 00:00:56.210
&gt;&gt; I WATCHED HER AND I THOUGHT

00:00:54.408 --> 00:00:58.312
SHE WAS EXTREMELY CREDIBLE AND

00:00:56.344 --> 00:00:59.814
I HAD GRAVE DOUBTS WHETHER HE

00:00:58.446 --> 00:01:00.147
COULD WIN THE CREDIBILITY

00:00:59.947 --> 00:01:01.916
CONTEST.

00:01:00.281 --> 00:01:04.218
BUT HE MADE A REMARKABLE

00:01:02.049 --> 00:01:07.221
COMEBACK AND HE REALLY

00:01:04.352 --> 00:01:09.156
TESTIFIED IN A COMPLETELY

00:01:07.355 --> 00:01:11.359
COMPELLING MANNER.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.927
SO I THINK IN THE END THERE IS

00:01:11.492 --> 00:01:13.861
A TIE WHEN IT COMES TO

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:15.663
PERSONAL CREDIBILITY.

00:01:13.995 --> 00:01:18.800
SO HOW DO YOU BREAK THE TIE?

00:01:15.796 --> 00:01:19.233
I THINK ONE WAY IS TO LOOK FOR

00:01:18.933 --> 00:01:21.602
CORROBORATION.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:23.538
AND HE HAS MUCH MORE

00:01:21.736 --> 00:01:27.441
CORROBORATION ON HIS SIDE.

00:01:23.671 --> 00:01:28.576
NOW THE BEST WAY TO MAKE SURE

00:01:27.575 --> 00:01:30.378
THAT CORROBORATION IS ACCURATE

00:01:28.709 --> 00:01:32.547
IS FOR THE COMMITTEE TO CALL

00:01:30.511 --> 00:01:34.315
THE OTHER WITNESSES.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:35.783
AND LET THE F.B.I. CONTINUE

00:01:34.448 --> 00:01:38.319
ITS BACKGROUND CHECK.

00:01:35.917 --> 00:01:42.423
AND I THINK IN THE END, IT

00:01:38.452 --> 00:01:42.757
WILL DO HIM MORE GOOD THAN

00:01:42.557 --> 00:01:44.559
HARM.

00:01:42.957 --> 00:01:45.626
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOW WHEN WE SPOKE

00:01:44.692 --> 00:01:47.228
YESTERDAY, YOU SAID THAT YOU

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:50.832
WERE CONCERNED ABOUT THE

00:01:47.361 --> 00:01:51.833
CHOICE OF RACHEL MITCHELL FROM

00:01:50.965 --> 00:01:52.466
MARICOPA COUNTY SEX CRIMES

00:01:51.966 --> 00:01:54.268
INVESTIGATION OFFICE IN

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:55.937
ARIZONA TO SPEAK ON BEHALF OF

00:01:54.402 --> 00:01:56.771
REPUBLICAN SENATORS IF THEY

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:58.372
QUESTION CHRSTINE BLASEY FORD.

00:01:56.904 --> 00:01:59.140
YOUR POINT -- WELL, WE HAVE A

00:01:58.506 --> 00:02:01.008
CLIP.

00:01:59.273 --> 00:02:01.442
I'LL SHOW YOU YOUR POINT.

00:02:01.209 --> 00:02:03.945
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:02:01.642 --> 00:02:09.150
&gt;&gt; I SEE THE GREATEST ENGINE

00:02:04.078 --> 00:02:09.951
OF TRUTH EVER INVENTED USED

00:02:09.283 --> 00:02:10.351
EFFECTIVELY, CROSS

00:02:10.084 --> 00:02:11.586
EXAMINATION.

00:02:10.485 --> 00:02:12.019
I WORRY WE DON'T HAVE THE

00:02:11.719 --> 00:02:14.789
RIGHT PEOPLE.

00:02:12.153 --> 00:02:16.224
THE WOMAN HIRED TO CONDUCT THE

00:02:14.922 --> 00:02:17.258
CROSS EXAMINATION PROBABLY

00:02:16.357 --> 00:02:17.625
RARELY EVER CROSS EXAMINED

00:02:17.392 --> 00:02:18.426
ANYBODY.

00:02:17.759 --> 00:02:20.728
SHE IS A PROSECUTOR.

00:02:18.559 --> 00:02:25.433
I DON'T THINK SHE IS THE RIGHT

00:02:20.862 --> 00:02:28.803
PERSON WHO QUESTION DR. FORD.

00:02:25.633 --> 00:02:29.104
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU KNOW YOU WERE

00:02:28.937 --> 00:02:30.371
RIGHT.

00:02:29.304 --> 00:02:32.040
&gt;&gt; I WAS CRITICIZED FOR MAKING

00:02:30.505 --> 00:02:32.740
THAT POINT I TURNED OUT TO BE

00:02:32.173 --> 00:02:35.944
100% RIGHT.

00:02:32.874 --> 00:02:40.281
SHE WAS TOTALLY AND COMPLETELY

00:02:36.077 --> 00:02:41.082
INCOMPETENT IN TERMS OF ASKING

00:02:40.415 --> 00:02:42.984
CROSS EXAMINATION QUESTIONS.

00:02:41.216 --> 00:02:45.487
SHE HAS LITTLE EXPERIENCE.

00:02:43.118 --> 00:02:47.956
FOR EXAMPLE, THE MAIN ISSUE

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:49.124
NOW IS WHETHER OR NOT SHE

00:02:48.089 --> 00:02:49.657
RECOGNIZED KAVANAUGH

00:02:49.257 --> 00:02:52.293
CORRECTLY.

00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:53.695
SHE WAS NEVER ASKED WHETHER

00:02:52.427 --> 00:02:56.231
HOW WELL SHE KNEW HIM, HOW

00:02:53.828 --> 00:02:57.332
MANY TIMES SHE ENCOUNTERED HIM

00:02:56.364 --> 00:02:59.200
BEFORE THIS.

00:02:57.465 --> 00:02:59.634
HOW CLOSE WAS THEIR

00:02:59.334 --> 00:03:02.237
RELATIONSHIP?

00:02:59.768 --> 00:03:03.471
THERE WAS NOTHING THAT COULD

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.040
RAISE QUESTIONS ABOUT WHETHER

00:03:03.605 --> 00:03:07.542
EVEN IF SHE BELIEVES SHE IS

00:03:05.173 --> 00:03:09.044
TELLING THE TRUTH, SHE MAY

00:03:07.676 --> 00:03:11.313
HAVE MISIDENTIFIED.

00:03:09.177 --> 00:03:11.746
SO SHE JUST DID A TERRIBLE

00:03:11.446 --> 00:03:14.149
JOB.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.283
I THINK THE REPUBLICANS

00:03:14.282 --> 00:03:16.551
REALIZED THAT AND THEY CANNED

00:03:15.417 --> 00:03:18.753
HER IN THE MIDDLE.

00:03:16.685 --> 00:03:21.389
BUT IT WAS A VERY BAD CHOICE.

00:03:18.954 --> 00:03:23.925
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO CAN I -- THOSE

00:03:21.523 --> 00:03:26.094
OF US WHO ASK QUESTIONS FOR A

00:03:24.059 --> 00:03:27.062
LIVING SAT AND WONDERED WHAT

00:03:26.228 --> 00:03:28.497
IS THE POINT OF THIS.

00:03:27.195 --> 00:03:29.431
NOT THAT SHE IS A BAD PERSON

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.832
OR STUPID.

00:03:29.564 --> 00:03:31.433
YOU HAVE BEEN AROUND

00:03:30.966 --> 00:03:31.767
CONGRESSIONAL TESTIMONY

00:03:31.566 --> 00:03:33.668
BEFORE.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.871
YOU HAVE TESTIFIED.

00:03:33.802 --> 00:03:37.706
WHEN YOU WERE ASKING QUESTIONS

00:03:36.004 --> 00:03:40.008
OF A WITNESS, AREN'T YOU DOING

00:03:37.839 --> 00:03:41.877
SO IN ORDER TO PROVE A POINT,

00:03:40.142 --> 00:03:43.645
TELL A STORY, YOU'RE DOING IT

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:45.881
FOR SOME REASON, AREN'T YOU?

00:03:43.845 --> 00:03:47.582
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE TO HAVE A THEORY.

00:03:46.014 --> 00:03:49.351
EVERY QUESTION HAS TO BE PART

00:03:47.716 --> 00:03:50.986
OF A TACTIC.

00:03:49.484 --> 00:03:53.121
YOU ASK QUESTION "A" IN ORDER

00:03:51.119 --> 00:03:56.024
TO LAY A FOUNDATION FOR "B."

00:03:53.255 --> 00:03:57.526
SHE WAS JUST ASKING QUESTIONS.

00:03:56.158 --> 00:03:57.893
IT JUST DOESN'T SEEM TO GO

00:03:57.659 --> 00:03:59.628
ANYWHERE.

00:03:58.026 --> 00:03:59.961
SHE DIDN'T HAVE MUCH OF A

00:03:59.761 --> 00:04:01.963
POINT.

00:04:00.095 --> 00:04:03.131
AND IN THE END, SHE

00:04:02.097 --> 00:04:04.132
ACCOMPLISHED NOTHING.

00:04:03.331 --> 00:04:04.766
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BRETT KAVANAUGH

00:04:04.266 --> 00:04:05.567
DEFENDED HIMSELF.

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.501
NOBODY ELSE WAS.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.636
OTHER THAN LINDSEY GRAHAM.

00:04:06.635 --> 00:04:08.770
THANK YOU.

00:04:07.769 --> 00:04:11.440
PROFESSOR, GREAT TO SEE YOU.

